        "Id": "73f38a0d-b463-4316-a3ec-03eaabebd37e",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Pernicious Press Pandering",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111994363369",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 13dd6c0e-9b9c-4521-88f3-a5de84f0e9b2).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 is not a guy that is easily fooled. Being a big fan of racing, even he can see the obvious corruption that runs deep within this business. Many vile individuals are getting very favorable press coverage. How can the media not pick up on the fact that many at the top of the foodchain here, are corrupt illegal pasta smugglers. Agent 47 is set to clear the deck by getting rid of the individuals that hide the corruption from the public.",
